                "description": "The Helios Lever with Square Rosette is wonderfully contemporary, with a sleek profile that is perfect for industrialized decor and modern lofts. The Modern Helios Door Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from an array of modern finishes including satin brass and polished chrome. The Contemporary Helios Leverset with Square Rose will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
